[{"type":"message","user":"U022P8W43GD","text":"\u003c@U022P8W43GD\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621779342.175300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U02265RSN07","text":"\u003c@U02265RSN07\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621770636.175000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a154882d-b2ac-464e-915e-4df5184d0b61","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そういう人はsquash mergeするね、でフォローしちゃうほうがいいのかもね","ts":"1621762530.174800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U016GRZN0GJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IPK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ac202d6-7577-4261-a806-1b11a2f26bff","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあねえ","ts":"1621762513.174400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bV87"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf03084-649a-4a6b-9e63-1ee56c1df1ca","type":"message","user":"U016GRZN0GJ","text":"PR前にrebase -iとかでコミット整えるの、若干スキル要求するのもあり、ベストエフォートな感じになっちゃう","ts":"1621762315.174200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c3Yvo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52916a00-5982-426d-95e7-257f0dd64246","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"```future/aaa▶▶▶develop(自動テスト＆レビュー)▶▶▶staging(直push禁止)▶▶▶main(直push禁止)\n…\n…\n…```\n自分のところはこんな感じでブランチ切られていますね。個人開発だとここまで細かく切らない方が逆にいいのですが。","ts":"1621754611.173600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TBWv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78811732-bdb2-4b8a-b762-12ac9b352eac","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; git merge --ff-only ore/hoge # マージコミットはつくらない\n\u0026gt; git push origin hoge\n一応ここの部分はプルリクエストで行われ（てマージコミットをあえて作）る運用もよくあるかなと思います。","ts":"1621754090.172200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yW="}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e3a572d-2e1e-4078-97c9-b13b8f14a0f3","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; 未pushのコミットをrebasingすべし\n個人的には自分用のブランチとして `ore/hoge-branch` みたいに自分用のディレクトリ (`ore`) 切ってそっちで作業するようにしておいて、そっちでカジュアルに `rebase`・`push --force` しちゃってます。\n\n```git checkout -b ore/hoge hoge\n...\n# 個人の作業コミット \ngit commit\ngit push origin ore/hoge\n...\n\n# hoge へ適用する前にきれいにする\ngit fetch origin hoge\ngit rebase -i origin/hoge\n\n# hoge に適用\ngit checkout -b hoge origin/hoge\ngit merge --ff-only ore/hoge # マージコミットはつくらない\ngit push origin hoge```","ts":"1621753949.170900","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1621754000.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uSri"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82bf94c3-ee02-46de-994a-dcc59b58e463","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、レビューの都合PRになったら基本rebaseはなし、みたいなのもある","ts":"1621751134.162300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7=Lk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f8cb749-9bac-4e4b-86b1-38d7fae9d59b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そっちは自分の管理下だから、ってのはあるけどね(共有じゃないの意味で)","ts":"1621751122.162000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c/W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62f6094a-5b2a-4da0-80d7-35990db68a2e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"PRのマージ前には整理しません？","ts":"1621750936.161600","thread_ts":"1621750936.161600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ig8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45c6bd0a-4659-4c4d-98c1-8e77943d9afa","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"rebaseはコミットIDまで書き換えちゃうからあくまで未pushのコミットをrebasingすべし\nまずこれを憶えた","ts":"1621750899.161300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tu8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dc23bf1-b4b7-4705-bd26-d626a7fec94e","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"一応ご参考程度に。\n\u003chttps://git-scm.com/book/ja/v2/Git-%E3%81%AE%E3%83%96%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%81%E6%A9%9F%E8%83%BD-%E3%83%AA%E3%83%99%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B9|Git のブランチ機能 - リベース\u003e\n\n（大事なことはみんな Pro Git book に教わった）","ts":"1621750512.160500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"66AH8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0ad727c-f70e-4085-9dcc-58b97a8f3d2d","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"ありがとうございます!","ts":"1621749839.158800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"man-gesturing-ok","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6j6oP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ea34af9-b293-461b-a4ee-58401c77fc9f","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"です！","ts":"1621749831.158600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rITP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bc5909c-e122-4c64-8b5a-3e94a7a691d8","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"意図を当初に戻して「無駄なマージコミットつけるな」問題の解消であればrebase使うやつですよね?","ts":"1621749792.158400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DOp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d8409a-3299-4ef5-bb59-bf12296526f9","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"多分合ってると思いますが、\n\u0026gt; pushできない問題が発生する可能性高スなので\nこれ予防したいということだけなら、必要なタイミング（シェアしたいタイミング）まで push しないでおくのが自然かなとは思います（そのつもりかもですが）","ts":"1621749567.155700","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1621749931.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"42mmO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d76c56b4-2f47-4121-9751-e76d2318e7b0","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"丁寧な解説ありがとうございます\n追跡ブランチは多分違うんだろうなーと思いながらやってたので再履修します\n\n流れを踏まえると\n同じブランチを複数人で編集してるときにpushできない問題が発生する可能性高スなのでそのときは\n```# hogeブランチにて\ngit fetch origin hoge\ngit rebase origin/hoge\ngit push → 成功!```\nが正しい理解?","ts":"1621749332.153100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GFR+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9ed550f-fbe1-4ec5-840d-b25cb94bf82c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/uasi/items/69368c17c79e99aaddbf\u003e\nこの辺が混乱してる気がする\n`git fetch` した後なら `git rebase origin/hoge` でまあ問題が片付くという...\n\n\u0026gt; git checkout origin/hoge\n\u0026gt; git merge hoge\nは、意図としては、ローカルのブランチを作ってそれをマージしたいだったんだと思いますが、この間に元の作業ブランチに戻る操作が書いてないと謎になりますな","ts":"1621749019.149900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: Git で「追跡ブランチ」って言うのやめましょう - Qiita","id":1,"title":"Git で「追跡ブランチ」って言うのやめましょう - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/uasi/items/69368c17c79e99aaddbf","text":"TL;DR 突然ですがクイズです。「追跡ブランチ (tracking branch)」という言葉の使い方で正しいのはどれだと思いますか？ origin/master はリモートリポジトリの master を追跡する追跡ブラ...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3DGit%2520%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2580%258C%25E8%25BF%25BD%25E8%25B7%25A1%25E3%2583%2596%25E3%2583%25A9%25E3%2583%25B3%25E3%2583%2581%25E3%2580%258D%25E3%2581%25A3%25E3%2581%25A6%25E8%25A8%2580%25E3%2581%2586%25E3%2581%25AE%25E3%2582%2584%25E3%2582%2581%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2582%2587%25E3%2581%2586%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D27f20a88360cc36a832f398f7ce938a9\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540uasi%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3Daa9429e5607fb4641a2ac8bd0e244913\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=3d60a0542d223764440f2ff8742ca496","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/uasi/items/69368c17c79e99aaddbf","original_url":"https://qiita.com/uasi/items/69368c17c79e99aaddbf"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PxUDP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59091eea-ee92-43a0-b4b2-7505edad83d0","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; `git push origin hoge` で、そのまま画像の下の状態になるはずです。\nいわゆる fast-forward な merge がリモート上で行われるということです。\n（通常の pull はローカル上でこれをやる）\n\norigin の hoge を push で更新すると、自動的にローカルの origin/hoge にも反映されます。\n冗長な説明かもですが。","ts":"1621748049.147200","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1621748199.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"szVU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fae7df51-42cd-4ad2-bc5b-81f1e6b93d15","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"（リモート origin 上の hoge も更新する前提で考えています）","ts":"1621747893.144900","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1621748175.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HNV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c562d0a2-92e3-4b64-8c41-129fca3b056d","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; git checkout origin/hoge\n\u0026gt; git merge hoge\norigin ってリモートですよね。\nローカルのブランチじゃない（`refs/heads/` 配下の参照ではない）ので、マージできないはずです。\n\u0026gt; git rebase origin/hoge\nのあとに\n`git push origin hoge` で、そのまま画像の下の状態になるはずです。","ts":"1621747835.144100","thread_ts":"1621741399.123800","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1621748138.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Ba"}],"root":{"type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"以前\u003c@UDPT2BZ6E\u003e さんがgitの運用について\n同じブランチを複数人が触る場合はfetch -\u0026gt; rebaseして不要なマージコミットをなくしてほしい\nという趣旨の発言がありましたが、rebase使ったことなかったのでどんな運用なのかなと思って調べました\n\nhogeブランチをみんなで触ってるとして、自分のhogeよりリモートのhogeが先に進んでしまっている状況にて\n状態を更新するために`git pull` するのではなく、\n```# 添付画像のコミット処理をしようとしている\ngit rebase origin/hoge\ngit checkout origin/hoge\ngit merge hoge```\n↑こんな感じかなと想像しました (switch, restoreは未習得なのでcheckoutしました\nイメージ図と実際のコマンドあってます?","ts":"1621741399.123800","thread_ts":"1621741399.123800","reply_count":1,"files":[{"id":"F023FPTTW0G","created":1621740988,"timestamp":1621740988,"name":"IMG_20210523_123545.jpg","title":"IMG_20210523_123545.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U01U44T1FK2","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":123074,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G/img_20210523_123545.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G/download/img_20210523_123545.jpg","original_h":2906,"original_w":2033,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":252,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_480.jpg","thumb_480_w":336,"thumb_480_h":480,"thumb_720":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_720.jpg","thumb_720_w":504,"thumb_720_h":720,"thumb_960":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_960.jpg","thumb_960_w":672,"thumb_960_h":960,"thumb_1024":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_1024.jpg","thumb_1024_w":716,"thumb_1024_h":1024,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U01U44T1FK2/F023FPTTW0G/img_20210523_123545.jpg","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-8abcd0951a","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"thumb_800":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_800.jpg","thumb_800_h":1144,"thumb_800_w":800,"thumb_tiny":"AwAwACG9ijFBB4waUD1oACKTFBwTkilBBFABRS4oxQAlAHekpQMHrmgA7UoppPPXilyO1ADqKTNGaAGZpRTaWgAzkmlpo6UooAfRSUUAf//Z","username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pmly"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"1b236e76-9243-4a8c-afda-f4b31a46824b","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; まだ未変更だからと適当な名前で一時コミットして、そのままド忘れしてpushする事故が防げるというのも。\nやらかしそー\n一旦系は名前付きstashかブランチ切って、忘れて、なんじゃこれってなって枯れるをやってますね","ts":"1621744750.143500","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621744862.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+SWe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad293f24-8342-47e0-b615-5a2d713119f2","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"自分はやった事ないですが、同僚が一度やらかした事があるもんで。","ts":"1621744490.142600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H8S6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f72564cf-9138-47a0-8dda-8b6a09b12d8d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"まだ未変更だからと適当な名前で一時コミットして、そのままド忘れしてpushする事故が防げるというのも。","ts":"1621744357.142100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W=jK="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a236515d-2a70-445c-b17c-3e4703a45275","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"stash vs conflictの頂上決戦が延長戦に持ち込まれるわけか","ts":"1621744223.140900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bqP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cc0d5e3-a1b1-4e91-b1a9-ea65b4534154","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"rebaseする→コンフリクト起きてたらマージして新しいコミットを作る→`git stash pop`で戻す→コンフリクトしていたらマージして新しいコミットに（ｒｙ\n個人的にはfixupを使って二つのコミットを統合してしまう事が多いです。","ts":"1621743974.138600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J4xA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f78c4b9-10e5-43e7-a0ad-bd87e03939f6","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; コミットしてから出直せやボケ（意訳）\nそういうことか。確かにcheckoutしようとして「やめろ」って言われたこともありますわ","ts":"1621743442.135800","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621743455.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GFriv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbaea187-bcde-4e4d-a85c-952558da1f71","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"すでにコミット済みの分とコンフリクトが起きてしまった場合はそのままどうマージするかに変わります。未コミット分と別々に処理できるようになるのが嬉しい感じですね。","ts":"1621743293.134900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aXY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e39bda2e-5148-416b-a88a-a39710a8fa9d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"近いというか、変更点がすべて反映（コミット）されていなければホントはrebaseできないんです。もしこの設定をtrueにしていなければ「コミットしてから出直せやボケ（意訳）」というエラーメッセージがでてきます。","ts":"1621742869.132300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9ApM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f077e1a-80a5-4062-84e5-5ea40fa03724","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"昔はtyruさんが便利なgitのオプションを見つけた！を定期的にやってくれてたけど戦場から戻らない・・・生きててくれればいいけど","ts":"1621742681.129800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kowawa","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aSL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b97ebcd9-14af-45cb-8006-ac19f8ff7efc","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"\u0026gt; rebase時に障害となる変更点を勝手にスタックへ避難させてくれる\nこれってgitが「あ、これコンフリクトしそう」って思ってよしなにスタッシュする感じですか?","ts":"1621742577.127600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6XUfW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75404d4a-f1d2-455f-9a3f-e95265ae651e","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"あとは`git config --global rebase.autoStash true`も入れておくとgitにブチ切れられなくなります。\n（rebase時に障害となる変更点を勝手にスタックへ避難させてくれる設定）","ts":"1621742443.126800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U01U44T1FK2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fVS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83733a8e-d064-4685-bb51-4306b73f5a67","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"自分はfetch + rebase派ですけど`git config --global pull.rebase true`をセットしておくと引数省略できて少しラクになります。","ts":"1621742112.125500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jLl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B2C3320C-C30E-46E8-876E-599DB3C407B8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":" git pull –rebase もあるよ\n\u003chttps://www.lancard.com/blog/2016/11/07/git-rebase-and-pull-rebase/|https://www.lancard.com/blog/2016/11/07/git-rebase-and-pull-rebase/\u003e","ts":"1621741865.124300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RIy"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"以前\u003c@UDPT2BZ6E\u003e さんがgitの運用について\n同じブランチを複数人が触る場合はfetch -\u0026gt; rebaseして不要なマージコミットをなくしてほしい\nという趣旨の発言がありましたが、rebase使ったことなかったのでどんな運用なのかなと思って調べました\n\nhogeブランチをみんなで触ってるとして、自分のhogeよりリモートのhogeが先に進んでしまっている状況にて\n状態を更新するために`git pull` するのではなく、\n```# 添付画像のコミット処理をしようとしている\ngit rebase origin/hoge\ngit checkout origin/hoge\ngit merge hoge```\n↑こんな感じかなと想像しました (switch, restoreは未習得なのでcheckoutしました\nイメージ図と実際のコマンドあってます?","ts":"1621741399.123800","thread_ts":"1621741399.123800","reply_count":1,"files":[{"id":"F023FPTTW0G","created":1621740988,"timestamp":1621740988,"name":"IMG_20210523_123545.jpg","title":"IMG_20210523_123545.jpg","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"U01U44T1FK2","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":123074,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G/img_20210523_123545.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G/download/img_20210523_123545.jpg","original_h":2906,"original_w":2033,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_64.jpg","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_80.jpg","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_160.jpg","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_360.jpg","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":252,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_480.jpg","thumb_480_w":336,"thumb_480_h":480,"thumb_720":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_720.jpg","thumb_720_w":504,"thumb_720_h":720,"thumb_960":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_960.jpg","thumb_960_w":672,"thumb_960_h":960,"thumb_1024":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F023FPTTW0G-f213553a38/img_20210523_123545_1024.jpg","thumb_1024_w":716,"thumb_1